-25.73],[1769904000,-14.18],[1772323200,-23.2],[1775001600,-40.31],[1777593600,-33.8],[1780272000,-24.27],[1782864000,-39.24],[1785542400,5.09],[1788220800,33.58]]}]}],"qna":[{"question":"What does MGNREGA - Work Demanded represent?","answer":"Mahatma Gandhi National Rural Employment Guarantee Act (MGNREGA) aims to enhance livelihood security in rural areas by providing at least 100 days of wage employment in a financial year to every household whose adult members volunteer to do unskilled manual work.^This indicator reflects the total number of days of work requested by eligible households under MGNREGA. It is a measure of the demand for work in rural areas under this scheme."},{"question":"What is the significance of MGNREGA - Work Demanded data?","answer":"The number of workdays demanded is a vital indicator of rural employment needs and economic distress, which helps the policy-makers to plan the need for rural welfare and employment schemes.^This data helps in assessing the effectiveness of MGNREGA in providing employment and also in understanding the economic conditions, particularly in rural India."},{"question":"How to interpret MGNREGA -  Work Demanded data?","answer":"A higher demand for work can signify increased unemployment or underemployment in rural areas, indicating growing rural distress or insufficient employment opportunities in the agri and industrial sectors. Conversely, a decreasing trend might imply better employment opportunities outside MGNREGA or improved economic conditions in rural areas.^The demand for work under MGNREGA is often seasonal, with more demand during agricultural off-seasons. This seasonal variation is crucial for understanding the rural economy's dynamics."}],"related":[{"slug":"baltic-dry-index","title":"Baltic Dry Index"},{"slug":"bank-credit-services","title":"Bank Credit - Services"},{"slug":"consumer-price-index-cpi-inflation-miscellaneous","title":"Consumer Price Index (CPI) Inflation - Miscellaneous"},{"slug":"domestic-air-passenger-traffic","title":"Air Passenger Traffic - Domestic"},{"slug":"domestic-passenger-car-sales","title":"Domestic Passenger Car Sales"},{"slug":"epfo-additions","title":"EPFO Payroll Additions"},{"slug":"goods-and-services-tax-gst-collections","title":"GST Collections"},{"slug":"government-capital-expenditure","title":"Government Capital Expenditure"},{"slug":"gross-tax-revenue","title":"Gross Tax Revenue"},{"slug":"hsbc-services-purchasing-managers-index-pmi","title":"HSBC Services PMI"},{"slug":"international-air-passenger-traffic","title":"Air Passenger Traffic - International"},{"slug":"port-cargo-traffic","title":"Port Cargo Traffic"},{"slug":"revenue-earnings-railway-freight-traffic-major-commodities","title":"Railway Freight Traffic- Revenue"},{"slug":"services-business-confidence","title":"Services Business Confidence"},{"slug":"services-trade-net-inflows","title":"Services Trade- Net Inflows"},{"slug":"two-wheeler-sales","title":"Domestic Two-Wheeler Sales"}],"title":"MGNREGA Work Demand","description":"MGNREGA work demanded stands at 15.6 Million for Sep 2026. This figure is closely tied to rural income conditions and agricultural cycles.","headline":{"Absolute":"MGNREGA work demanded stands at 15.6 Million for Sep 2026. This figure is closely tied to rural income conditions and agricultural cycles.","Y-o-Y":"MGNREGA work demanded stands at 33.58% for Sep 2026. This figure is closely tied to rural income conditions and agricultural cycles."},"source":"CMIE Economic Outlook, 1 Finance Research","source_url":"https://economicoutlook.cmie.com/","date_modified":"2026-09-01","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T15:06:25+00:00"}